  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "c_contracts/huntmaster",
      "title": "&cThe Huntmaster's Board",
      "subtitle": "She knows every rank and every trait. Ask nicely.",
      "icon": "minecraft:crossbow",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -0.25,
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "size": 2,
      "dependencies": [
        "s1_act2_hunt/hunters_moon"
      ],
      "description": [
        "The first red moon brought the Remnants out, and it brought &6Ilse&r with it. She hunted them before the Eclipse had a name, and she has never once been paid in thanks.",
        "",
        "&o\"You're the Ashborn who lit the shrine. Good. I need someone who gets back up. I post contracts, you fill them, I pay. Nothing personal, nothing owed.\"&r",
        "",
        "Every contract on this board can be taken again once it's paid. Kills count from the moment a contract is posted; collect, and it's posted again from zero.",
        "",
        "&7Under a Hunter's Moon the board pays the same. The shards don't."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "c_contracts/huntmaster/task0",
          "type": "checkmark",
          "title": "I'll take Ilse's contracts"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "c_contracts/huntmaster/reward0",
          "type": "command",
          "command": "/lastlight arrive huntmaster {p}",
          "title": "Ilse the Huntmaster comes to Last Light",
          "icon": "minecraft:crossbow"
        },
        {
          "id": "c_contracts/huntmaster/reward1",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "remnant_mobs:brand_of_challenge"
        },
        {
          "id": "c_contracts/huntmaster/reward2",
          "type": "xp",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ]
    },
    {
